      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 480,
        "height": 848,
        "content": "## Rescue at-risk gym members with Google Sheets, Gemini and Twilio SMS\n\n### How it works\n\nRuns weekly on a schedule to fetch active members and attendance records from Google Sheets.\nComputes a churn risk score for each member and filters out low-risk accounts.\nFetches detailed member profiles and uses a Gemini-powered AI agent to craft customized re-engagement copy.\nValidates contact details and limits batch processing to 10 recipients per execution.\nDispatches messages via Twilio and logs sent communications in Google Sheets.\n\n### Setup steps\n\n- - [ ] Connect Google Sheets credentials and select sheets for members, attendance, profiles, and outreach logs.\n- - [ ] Set up Google Gemini credentials for the Rescue Strategy Agent chat model.\n- - [ ] Connect Twilio credentials with an active phone number or messaging service.\n- - [ ] Adjust the schedule trigger time to your preferred day and frequency.\n\n### Customization\n\nYou can customize the churn scoring algorithm in the Compute Churn Risk Score node, tweak the AI retention prompt in the Rescue Strategy Agent, or modify the batch limit from 10 items to your preferred outreach rate."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
