    {
      "id": "b5efd729-0206-490b-b505-9da6c56a7942",
      "name": "Member Retention Agent",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "position": [
        -96,
        800
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "text": "=You are a retention specialist for a gym.\n\nAnalyze the member's profile along with their upstream churn metrics and generate an internal risk diagnosis plus a personalized re-engagement SMS message.\n\n---\n\n### Member Profile Data\n{{ JSON.stringify($json) }}\n\n### Churn Risk Metrics (From Upstream Analysis)\n- Risk Score: {{ $('Calculate Churn Risk Score').item.json.risk_score }}/100 - Days Since Last Visit: {{$('Calculate Churn Risk Score').item.json.days_since_last_visit }} days\n- Visits (Last 30 Days): {{ $('Calculate Churn Risk Score').item.json.visits_last_30 }} - Attendance Drop: {{$('Calculate Churn Risk Score').item.json.drop_pct }}%\n\n---\n\n### Instructions & Constraints\n1. **Diagnosis (`reason`):**\n   - Provide a concise, single-line internal assessment explaining the drop-off by correlating their attendance gap with their profile (e.g., membership type, workout preferences).\n2. **Re-engagement Message (`message`):**\n   - **Tone:** Casual, warm, and low-pressure. Never guilt-trip or sound like a generic marketing blast.\n   - **Personalization:** Address them by first name and reference their listed preferences (e.g., cardio, weekend workouts, evening slots, PT) or routine.\n   - **Length:** Strict maximum of 300 characters.\n3. **Delivery Flag (`sms_eligible`):**\n   - Set to `true` if the member has a usable contact profile and valid context to reach out. Otherwise, set to `false`.",
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "You are a churn-prevention specialist. Be concise, warm, never pushy."
        },
        "promptType": "define",
        "hasOutputParser": true
      },
      "typeVersion": 1.7
    },
